[ROCm] Add occupancy_report to hip_resource_info

The compiler's resource usage already records Occupancy and ScratchSize per
kernel, but nothing converts them to blocks per compute unit, which is the
number that decides whether a kernel can use the LDS it was sized for. Add a
small helper with warnings for scratch use and for register-limited kernels.

diff --git a/testing/python/amd/test_tilelang_hip_occupancy_report.py b/testing/python/amd/test_tilelang_hip_occupancy_report.py
